Solutions to all three questions of the <University of Oxford> Part A <linear algebra> paper, sat on 15 June 2021. Source: https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/bsc_mathematics_part_a_examinati/response/2820674/attach/3/FOI%20202410%20944%20Data.pdf#page=253[released examination PDF, parent PDF pages 253–254; paper pages 1–2]. All questions and parts are covered, including both alternatives in questions asking whether an assertion is true.

